    ('c086510a-dc65-4f32-ae34-f86578bd7cdf'::uuid, 'card_description', 'On a plateau above the Grand Harbour, the Kordin Temples keep a stone-paved forecourt found in no other temple of Malta. The first part is believed to have been built around 3700 BC.', 'Megalithic temples from 3700-2500 BC overlooking the Grand Harbour. Originally three temple complexes, but only one survives today.', 'teaser-card-s025-rollback:c086510a-dc65-4f32-ae34-f86578bd7cdf:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s025: card_description ''Megalithic temples from 3700-2500 BC overlooking the Grand Harbour. Originally three temple complexes, but only one survives today.'' restored on Kordin Temples', 'e2277927367727693fb8fe25cacc5f6a99ae4d7853a8991ea5a829542ecaf69b|2346e87237b8174c40a0adab5e3378e61f9b644d30c935a5edc7ac10acbfc414|2346e87237b8174c40a0adab5e3378e61f9b644d30c935a5edc7ac10acbfc414', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: writer teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-write-022", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "On a plateau above the Grand Harbour, the Kordin Temples keep a stone-paved forecourt found in no other temple of Malta. The first part is believed to have been built around 3700 BC."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: checker teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-check-022 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "the Kordin Temples stand on a plateau [S2]; the plateau overlooks the Grand Harbour [S2]; the temple has a stone-paved forecourt [S6]; such stone paving is found in no other temple of Malta [S7]; the first part of the temple is believed to have been built around 3700 BC [S8]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-verify-066 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "The Kordin Temples are megalithic temples [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/